  - You get pulled over while driving, the police seem not friendly...
  - Your household income seems lower than your neighbor's
  genderInequityPopups:
  - You have been denied a promotion because you are pregnant and planning to take parental leave...
  - It is more difficult to own a business as a woman
  - Your earnings are approximately 21.1% lower than those of your male counterparts...
  - You work one hour longer each day than men do...
