  disabilityInequityPopups:
  - You have increased medical expenses
  - You are unable to work due to disability
  - Disability payments are not enough to cover higher cost of living
  educationInequityPopups:
  - You fall behind peers due to lack of educational resources.
  - Your wages aren't enough to cover the cost of tuition
  - A colleague from a more prestigious university receives higher pay for the same job
  - You are denied promotion due to not having a higher degree
  - Your job application is rejected due to not having a higher degree
  housingInequityPopups:
